  "title": "Ph Life Insurance Handbook — Available Policy Categories:",
  "content": "### Available Policy Categories:\n1. **Darwix SecureTerm (Term Life Insurance)**:\n   - Pure protection policy providing maximum financial security at affordable premium rates.\n   - Coverage terms: 5 years, 10 years, 20 years, or term-to-age-65.\n   - Face amount coverage: Minimum ₱500,000 up to ₱10,000,000.\n   - Renewable and convertible to permanent life insurance without evidence of insurability before age 60.\n\n2. **Darwix LifeHeritage (Whole Life Insurance)**:\n   - Permanent life insurance providing lifetime coverage up to age 100 with guaranteed cash values and policy loan privileges.\n   - Premium payment options: Regular Pay up to age 65, 10-Pay (fully paid in 10 years), or 20-Pay.\n   - Face amount coverage: Minimum ₱1,000,000 up to ₱25,000,000.\n\n3. **Darwix InvestShield (Variable Unit-Linked / VUL)**:\n   - Hybrid protection and investment-linked life insurance. Premiums are allocated between life protection and professionally managed Philippine equity, bond, and balanced funds.\n   - Face amount: Minimum 125% of single premium or 5x annual premium.\n\n---",
